        "explanation": "getCalendar became async, so the forEach callback was made async. The enclosing try/catch (vital and wipemycalother reschedule.ts, around lines 124-137) only wrapped synchronous work before. A failure in getCalendar (for example the CalendarService constructor throwing, or a failed dynamic import of the app module) or in deleteEvent/deleteMeeting now rejects a floating promise. The catch block never sees it, and the code after the loop does not wait for the deletions.",
